{"id":"vod_sn_39150","vodId":"39150","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"罪恶王冠","name_cn":"罪恶王冠","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0a0432e58d945315b8c732a17b06098a.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在2029年，被病毒袭击的日本陷入了混乱之后被名为“GHQ”的暴力组织全面接手，政府逐渐成为了傀儡。在这样动荡的大环境下，樱满集（梶裕贵 配音）只是一名平凡的高中生，过着属于他的平凡生活，直到那个叫做楪祈（茅野爱衣 配音）的少女出现在他的眼前。　　祈的真实身份为“葬仪社”的成员，这个社团以从GHQ的手上夺回日本自治权为目标不断进行着危险而残酷的战争。在组织首领恙神涯（中村悠一 配音）的引导之下，集成为了组织的一员，结识了同僚筱宫绫濑（花泽香菜 配音）和鸫（竹达彩奈 配音）等人。随着战斗的升级，各种迹象显示出集似乎拥有着神秘的力量，而躲在诸多敌人背后的究竟是怎样强大的存在，众人无从而知……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:07:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":22,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GDaPpHK8BT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Pw5PZ4dhsv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CRru6U8aQy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/1gM2BFZ4UD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/28W9W6qC5c1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/3ZK7ZWDnA71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/42GGffAecx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/deK1GqXrKA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QnsAjBPPea1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/9FBDDAitvK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZKAvzZVeWm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/HncZ19u7Zy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/SZZu5N0v0z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Fr8eeN9ZQ01/video/index.m3u8"},{